# tak-uas-fleet — three-vehicle UAS spectate wall (compressed edge legs).
#
# One pane per vehicle, each on its own vid9p/vdec mount of the perception
# node's per-feed MPEG-TS broadcast (manto-annotated, one encode per feed):
#   vehicle 1  heph :5602  ->  /tmp/vision/0
#   vehicle 2  heph :5604  ->  /tmp/visionb/0
#   vehicle 3  heph :5606  ->  /tmp/visionc/0
# The fourth cell carries the transport controls for vehicle 1's feed
# (DVR replay of the retained window; stop snaps to live).
#
#   demo-tak-fleet.sh      # tunnels + mounts + this composition
#
# This is the multi-UAS operator-spectate view: fly any bird from
# nerv-gcs (select-vehicle.sh repoints the handset video), watch all
# three here with manto boxes burned in.

layout hsplit 50 50
left  vsplit 50 50
right vsplit 50 50

left/top     video-pane /tmp/vision/0
left/bottom  video-pane /tmp/visionb/0
right/top    video-pane /tmp/visionc/0
right/bottom video-ctl  /tmp/vision/0
